// micasurvivor_expedition_league_test.mjs — MicaSurvivor DLC D4: the Expedition League (roster, kits, in-run evolution,
// Maturity, stats from base stats). micasurvivor/js/expedition/league.js + league-data.js (GENERATED by
// tools/micasurvivor/gen_league.mjs); Plans/MICASURVIVOR_POKEBONK_DLC_STUDY.md 2.1, the owner's roster updates, the D4 row.
// A static server, headless Chrome, a fixed guest profile. One browser at a time (and it always exits).
//   0. the data (Node): 78 members built + 170 stubs = the owner's 249 entries; the starter trios free; every kit 4 of our
//      own moves; every stage's base stats and evolutions straight from the overworld's tables (+ the 7 newer ones);
//      the server's Expedition save merge keeps the League sets and counters (union / max) from two devices
//   1. the League pick: the Classic card says "League member: Bulbasaur"; its screen lists the 78 (12 free), a member's
//      kit (Lv 1 / 2 / 4 / 7), evolution line, passive and challenge; a starter is picked (Charmander) and a locked one
//      can't be; Esc / Back; the run then starts as Charmander (the run's dex, the replay header); English only
//   2. stats from base stats: HP, armor, speed, attack (physical vs special per move) for Charmander, Bulbasaur, Squirtle
//   3. the kit: moves unlock at Lv 1 / 2 / 4 / 7 through the real level-up screen (its note), no new-move cards
//   4. evolving mid-run: Charmander -> Charmeleon at 16 -> Charizard at 36 (sprite, types, stats, HP back up, the move
//      class rescaled, glide); no Maturity at 24 (it still evolves), Maturity 1 at 44; the run-over lines
//   5. challenges: the run's counters complete some (Kangaskhan: evolve twice) and not others (Dratini: a win too);
//      the Expedition save keeps league.met; a reload keeps it; ExpSave.merge unions / maxes; the base save byte-equal
//   6. Maturity at 24 and 44 on a member that never evolves (Kangaskhan): +12 % damage and max HP each
//   7. a branch: Ralts -> Kirlia at 20, at 30 the cards ARE the choice (Gardevoir / Gallade, their sprites; a reroll keeps
//      them); Gallade picked: Psychic / Fighting, it climbs; Maturity at 44
//   8. viewers: the `x` block v4 carries `l` on live snapshots, host and guest frames and the replay; a fresh page as
//      co-op guest (a host frame through G.Net), as the host of a guest (its frame), live spectator and replay viewer
//      (seeking before / after the evolution) show the right member and form; a v3 block (no `l`) still loads; dv 3
//   9. the phone (844 x 390, touch): the League screen and the level-up screen with its note fit, taps work
//  10. screenshots (SHOTS=<dir>): the League pick, a kit unlock, an evolution choice, at desktop and phone size
//   node overworld/tests/micasurvivor_expedition_league_test.mjs
// (In a git worktree add MAGEPUNK_ASSET_ROOT=<main checkout> for the gitignored sprites. MICASURVIVOR_ROOT=<dir> serves
//  micasurvivor/ from another tree: how the "fails before D4" count was taken.)
